/v1/","context":{"app_id":5046850,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1847286114040226","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"Launch week: a clearer demo, new sound, and a fact check","summary":"Stellar Nursery comes out on Wednesday, November 4, at 10 AM Pacific. Here is everything that changed on the way there: the demo got clearer because a streamer told us where it was confusing, the whole game got new sound, its skies came alive, and we checked every real fact in it against NASA. You asked, we built it (in the demo now) This week a Twitch streamer played the whole demo and told us, honestly, where it got confusing: what clicking the star does, and what owning 20 of an upgrade reall","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T17:28:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040226","verified_at":"2026-10-24T19:08:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1846651706684498","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"Living Worlds: a whole new Stellar Nursery","summary":"If the last Stellar Nursery you saw was our September demo, you saw a different game. Since then we have rebuilt nearly all of it: how it looks, how you get around, what the worlds do, and what you hear. The free demo has the new version today, in time for Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26. P.O.R.T.I.A.'s voice in the new trailer is mine. I recorded it myself. A new lookThe busy panels are gone. The station console, the tape deck and the stream of messages that crowded the edges of the screen ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:49:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684498","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1843481262690736","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.3: less at once, and a lot better to look at","summary":"The clearest thing people told us about the demo was that there was too much on screen too early. A station console, a tape deck, a puzzle shelf and a panel of systems, all at once, before you had lit anything. So the demo has been rebuilt around the first hour. THE DEMO, UPDATED TODAYAll of this is playable right now, free. The console introduces itself one piece at a timeA new save no longer opens with every system out. Each one arrives the first time it means something. The radio turns up whe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T01:05:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690736","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1842846814440886","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.2.3: Mac frame rate fixed, and a gentler opening","summary":"Two days after the big one, a patch. Most of it came from watching people play the last build. Mac players: please try again If you played the demo on a Mac through Steam this past week, it ran at about 20 frames per second, and that was our bug, not your machine. The Steam overlay helper we ship for Windows was also running on Mac, where the overlay has never worked, and it was costing more than half the frame rate. It is off on Mac now. On the same MacBook the demo went from 22 fps to 165. If ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T16:08:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440886","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1842846814438810","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.2: a new opening, worlds lit by their star, and a Windows fix","summary":"First demo update since August 20, and it is a big one. Here is everything that changed. The opening The game now opens on a Portia Plays studio card, then the title emerges out of black over a living star field. Any click or key skips ahead. First-time players skip the card and go straight into PORTIA's boot sequence. Boot lines animate in properly, and skipping the boot fades instead of cutting. Continue only appears when there is actually a save to continue. Light The star has always been on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T23:36:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814438810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1842212951298438","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is live","summary":"The demo is liveYou can play Stellar Nursery right now, free, on this page.The demo runs from a dead solar system through the first Reignite, which is somewhere around two hours depending on how much you poke at things. Everything past that point is in the full game, and the demo will show you where it stops rather than pretending it was never there.What it is: the sun went out a long time ago and the worlds emptied. You relight the star, then go world by world, seeding life onto dead rock and w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T00:13:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1841579228667290","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"Cosmetic Layers","summary":"Idle games have a reputation, and we understood it going in. Numbers go up, you close the tab. We built one anyway, because the part we actually wanted to make was the part nobody expects to find. Here is a full accounting of one of those layers: the 122 ways you can change how Stellar Nursery looks.Planet themes 58A theme here is not a skin on one planet. It is a recipe, and one purchase dresses every body you own: the planets, their moons, and the sun itself. Equip Stained Glass and the whole ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T01:12:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667290","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1841579228667286","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"The Five Mini Games Inside the Idle Game","summary":"Someone asked whether the \"Deep Invest\" button next to a quick action was just a bigger version of the same thing. It is not. Every deep action in the Nurture console opens its own real minigame, and until now the only way to know that was to click one yourself. So here are all five.↑ Seed Life, on EarthSeed Life is the only one-time action in the whole console. Drag four glowing seeds out of the dark and onto the waiting planet before they drift past it. Get all four planted and Earth ignites f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T01:09:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667286","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5046850-1841579228667261","game_id":"steam-5046850","kind":"announcement","title":"All about the UI","summary":"Every panel in Stellar Nursery is custom. No UI framework, no template. This is a close look at the console.The tape deck is a real tape deck. A cassette with its own handwritten label, spinning reels, a live VU meter, EQ bars, and bass and treble knobs that answer when you turn them.On PORTIA's desk there is a harmonograph that draws Lissajous figures from your solar system's actual orbital resonances, a prime spiral with Euler's polynomial picked out in gold, a double pendulum, and her tapping","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T00:54:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667261","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5046850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5046850":"2026-10-25T22:31:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5046850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5118130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:31:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5046850","app_id":5046850,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2431445fb2b58dd5a7704db6686a0ced86991a6bd85486a524e9637372a1ea7e","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Relight a dead sun and tend the worlds that circle it. Earth comes back to life, builds a city you name, and keeps a written record of all that follows. P.O.R.T.I.A., the caretaker who waited a hundred thousand years, keeps the watch with you. A quiet idle game that works while you are away.","publishers":[{"name":"Portias Publishing LLC"}],"developers":[{"name":"Portia Plays","creator_clan_account_id":46537049}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Stellar Nursery: Living Worlds (Official Trailer)","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792925862","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5046850/1024322627/5060376689720c6c62b04fbf63f8b035dcc80479/1792099947/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"5046850/1024322627/5060376689720c6c62b04fbf63f8b035dcc80479/1792099947/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"5046850/1024322627/5060376689720c6c62b04fbf63f8b035dcc80479/1792099947/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"5046850/1024322627/5060376689720c6c62b04fbf63f8b035dcc80479/1792099947/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"5046850/1024322627/5060376689720c6c62b04fbf63f8b035dcc80479/1792099947/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257463529/390a351edceaf880db6b00dec2f907f4dfd5f389/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257463529/390a351edceaf880db6b00dec2f907f4dfd5f389/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1385496,"all_ages":true}]}},"field_present":{"basic_info":true,"release":true,"trailers":true},"field_status":{"basic_info":"ok","release":"ok","trailers":"ok"},"field_errors":{},"developers":["Portia Plays"],"publishers":["Portias Publishing LLC"],"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Stellar Nursery: Living Worlds (Official Trailer)","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=17929258